---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /blog/index.html
title: "Blog: Ben Doyle Gray Photography"
description: "Notes from Ben Doyle Gray: the dogs, the sessions, and the frames behind them."
navKey: blog
barLabel: Blog
css: ["/assets/css/blog.css"]
---
      <header class="work-head">
        <h1 class="cell">Blog</h1>
        <div class="work-head__body cell">
          <p class="standfirst">
            The dogs, the sessions, and the frames behind them.
          </p>
          <a class="go go--inline" href="/blog/feed.xml"
            ><span>Follow by RSS</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a
          >
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="block" aria-label="Posts">
        {%- if collections.posts.length %}
        <ol class="entries">
          {%- for post in collections.posts %}
          <li>
            <a class="entry cell" href="{{ post.url }}">
              <span class="entry__num">&#9656; {{ collections.posts.length - loop.index0 }}</span>
              <time class="entry__date" datetime="{{ post.date | shortDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
              <h2 class="entry__title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
              {%- if post.data.description %}
              <p class="entry__blurb">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
              {%- endif %}
            </a>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
        {%- else %}
        <p class="entries__none cell label">Nothing on the roll yet.</p>
        {%- endif %}
      </section>
